      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Most NB insurers won't renew your policy on an aging steel tank. We swap it out same-week, $3,000 to $5,500 installed, and send the compliance paperwork straight to your insurer.</p>
