<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you're looking into oil tank replacement in Moncton, odds are the letter from your insurance company came first. Most NB insurers now require exterior steel tanks to be replaced at the 10 to 15 year mark, and if you don't, they can refuse to renew your policy. That letter reads scarier than it is, and the fix is more straightforward than most homeowners expect.</p><p>Hub City Tank Co replaces residential heating oil tanks across Moncton, <a href="/oil-tank-service-dieppe/">Dieppe</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-riverview/">Riverview</a> and the rest of Southeast New Brunswick. We handle the whole job: draining and removing your old tank, installing the new one to code, and sending your insurer the compliance certificate they're asking for. Most swaps are booked within the week and finished in a single visit. Call (506) 802-3471 for a free written estimate.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
