        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Same-week swap</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Once you approve the estimate, we can usually book your replacement within the same week. The whole swap is done in one visit, with your heat back on the same day.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Insurance paperwork handled</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We send the compliance certificate directly to your insurance company after the install. No chasing paperwork, no back and forth.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Installed to NB code</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Every tank goes in to the NB Petroleum Product Storage and Handling Regulation. That's exactly what your insurer needs to see before they'll renew.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Steel or fiberglass options</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We install standard steel tanks and fiberglass double-bottom tanks. We'll lay out the cost and lifespan of each so you can pick what fits your house and budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Old tank removed and disposed</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Removal and proper disposal of your old tank is part of the job, not an add-on. We transfer your usable oil into the new tank so nothing goes to waste.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
